'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Map of Tarkov|location]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''. It is the third map that was added to the game.

==Description==
The Priozersk Nature Reserve recently became part of the state-protected wildlife reserves of the North-Western Federal District.

==Notes==
{{PAGENAME}} is initially only accessible by [[Transits|transiting]]. Direct access from the location selection screen is unlocked upon progressing through the story chapter [[Tour]].

==Features==
* Stationary weapons in the form of [[NSV Utyos 12.7x108 heavy machine gun]]s.
* Be aware of [[Map of Tarkov#Border Snipers|Border Snipers]] and [[Map of Tarkov#Minefields|Minefields]]!

