==Trivia==
* The location was first expanded with [[Changelog#v0.6.0.861_(19_Jan_2018)|patch 0.6.0.861]] on January 19, 2018.
* The location was expanded for the second time with [[Changelog#0.12.9.10423_(24_Dec_2020)|patch 0.12.9.10423]] on December 24, 2020. Notably adding the Old Sawmill, which is a standalone map in Escape from Tarkov's predecessors, Contract Wars and Hired Ops, and was also later introduced to [[Arena]].
* The location was expanded again with [[Changelog#0.16.0.0.34447_(26_December_2024)|patch 0.16.0.0.34447]] on December 26, 2024.

